.TH XMRENDERTABLECOPY 3 2026-09-16 "Motif 2.0"
.SH NAME
XmRenderTableCopy - Copy a render table

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <Xm/Xm.h>

\fBXmRenderTable XmRenderTableCopy\fR(\fBXmRenderTable\fR table,
\fB                               \fR \fBXmStringTag *\fRtags,
\fB                               \fR \fBint\fR tag_count);
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new render table, duplicating renditions matching the given list
of tags into it.

.IP "\fItable\fP" 12
Source table to copy.
.IP "\fItags\fP" 12
Array of tags to match, or \fBNULL\fP to duplicate the whole table.
.IP "\fItag_count\fP" 12
Number of entries in the tag list.

.SH RETURN VALUE
A newly-created \fBXmRenderTable\fP or \fBNULL\fP on failure. The
resulting render table must be freed with \fBXmRenderTableFree\fP(3).

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBXmRenderTableFree\fP(3)

.SH AUTHOR
Tim Hentenaar <tim@hentenaar.com>

\"vi:set ft=groff:
